# Ubuntu's desktop, listed here in place of Ubuntu's metapackages
# (ubuntu-desktop-minimal and ubuntu-minimal 1.570.4): their Depends and
# Recommends, less Ubuntu Pro's client (ubuntu-pro-client), Software Updater
# (update-manager, and update-notifier and ubuntu-release-upgrader-gtk,
# which need it), Ubuntu's Help (ubuntu-docs, whose place patrone-branding
# takes), Canonical's hardware-certification tool (hwctl) and connectivity
# check (Patrone's is GNOME's), the crash reporter and system reports
# (below), Firefox, Ptyxis and Resources (Patrone Task Manager takes its
# place). desktop/README.md says why each.
Package: patrone-desktop
Architecture: all
